    "title": "Prescott Valley Police Department Receives Multiple Grants to Improve Highway and Street Safety - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Editor ,\n1 days ago The Governor's Office of Highway Safety awarded five new grants for the Fiscal Year 2026-2027 to the Prescott Valley Police Department (PVPD), all of which promise to improve safety on local streets and highways. The PVPD would like to thank the Governor’s Office of Highway Safety for partnering with us to improve the safety of the roadways in and around Prescott Valley. Read full article",
